--- lookup_hs_codes ---
Look up Harmonized System (HS) commodity codes used in international trade. Use when analyzing trade/shipment data, filtering by product type, or when the user asks about HS codes. Optionally filter by specific codes to get descriptions.
{
  "properties": {
    "codes": {
      "anyOf": [
        {
          "items": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "type": "array"
        },
        {
          "type": "null"
        }
      ],
      "default": null,
      "title": "Codes"
    }
  },
